{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_blkngt_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_blkngt_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "荒地生靈",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_blkngt_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c304e94cd6c8a9d986654b476cc209a55e100833423be048a5d89edc1df4d86f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "桑葚小姐，作為夜半小姐的引導人，這件事你怎麼看呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博、博士，我想，按夜半小姐說一不二的個性，應該剛遞交完申請書就離開這裡了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你聽起來好像有些埋怨她。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "所以，你同意她離去嗎？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......不過我的想法也沒那麼重要，博士，我想問問您的意見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "算了，既然她已經離開，我們再討論也沒有什麼必要。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感覺博士您好像也不太開心的樣子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "沒有，你多想了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "嗯咳，你多慮了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你知道她為什麼選擇離開嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不過，我很好奇她離開的原因。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我也不知道原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......我本來以為她早已適應了這裡的生活，雖然我初次見她的時候，她確實顯得不太自在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時她的病情不太穩定，所以應醫療部的建議，決定駐艦成為正式幹員，以便他們隨時觀察。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我被任命為她的引導人，帶她熟悉艦內大小事宜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......你就是我在這艘船上的隊長？看你這小胳膊小腿，你能保護我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夜、夜半小姐，我的體能雖然比不上你，但如果遇到危險，我也會傾盡所能保護你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，挺有自信嘛，看你表現好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......以後我和你就住在這屋子裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然夜半小姐你的病情還沒有嚴重到要住進醫療部的程度，但也是需要時刻關注的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這段時間，為了方便監測你的健康狀況，我會與你同住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的窗戶打不開嗎？我想吹吹風。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得溫度太高了？我這就把空調打開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在感覺怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......感覺有點不對勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夜半小姐，你是不太舒服嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許吧，可能是我身體的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，那個，冒犯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，你要做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感覺你額頭的溫度很正常......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一會吃完晚飯我們可以去醫療部做一個更為細緻的檢查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......我看應該沒什麼問題，醫療部就不用去了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確定嗎？你看起來不太舒服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，差點忘了把這個給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "護身符。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道這是護身符，但是這一串也太多了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想......多的話，會更加靈驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先說好，我是不會把這一堆東西掛在身上到處跑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用帶出去，掛在櫃子裡也可以的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不了吧，香火味太濃了，衣服會變得難聞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對、對不起，是我考慮不周！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘖，我就說了，和你們這樣的嬌嬌女打交道是真的麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗚，好難相處啊......不行，再怎麼說，這也是我的任務，得努力和她打好關係才行。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......你想去哪裡看看嗎？我帶你去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用了，你站住，不要跟著我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有可是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夜半小姐，等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很長一段時間裡，我以為是夜半小姐她性格如此，不願意和人親近，再加上初來乍到，有些拘謹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......現在看來，她只是不喜歡這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但當時她並沒有直接離開。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "可她為什麼現在才選擇離開？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上個月，我們的外出救援任務結束，從荒地回到了艦船上。不久後她就向我提出要辭去正式幹員的職位，恢復合作幹員的身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，或許是荒地上發生的一些事情讓她對這裡產生了不滿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又或許......問題出在我身上，是我讓她無法忍受繼續留在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別亂想，這純屬無稽之談。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "相信我，夜半小姐絕不會這樣想。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您......博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "介意將你們在荒地上的經歷講給我聽聽嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實，這也是讓我一直百思不得其解的地方，因為在我看來，這段經歷並沒有什麼讓人煩惱的地方。相反，我覺得它很有趣，也很愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為，經過這次外勤任務，我和夜半小姐親近了不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "甚至說，我覺得她已經融入了我們的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先說好，這次到外面你要聽我的，不許拖我後腿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我是隊長啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你比我能打嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在荒地上生活的時間比我久嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也沒有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我為什麼要聽你的命令？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......噗嗤，哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夜半小姐你......為什麼突然笑了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼，看你這呆頭呆腦的樣子，覺得有些好玩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛剛的話......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都是逗你玩的。明明任務都快要結束了，你還一副緊張兮兮的樣子，天天拘在帳篷裡面，我這次非得把你拉到外面逛逛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還以為那些話是我的真心話嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實話說，我之前確實這麼認為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......原來不是錯覺啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但那都是我的偏見，不是嗎？和你相處這麼久，你所做的點點滴滴都已經足夠向我證明，你非常優秀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼突然就開始誇我，多、多不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼不好意思？做得好就應該被大家讚揚。我還記得那位老人家，誰都覺得沒戲，但你居然真想到法子把她救出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有大家的幫忙，我也做不到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少和我扯這些，誇你厲害就是因為你厲害，不許懷疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給，接著，嚐嚐吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，你怎麼這麼近都接不到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，你吃另外一個吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你不要撿那個果子了，掉在地上不衛生，吃了要肚子痛的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事多，就破了點皮，怎麼就不能吃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好歹拿袖子擦擦呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好、好吃，我從來沒有吃過這種果子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一次，我和同伴行進的路線上有一片靠近河流的樹林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "林子裡長著很多這樣的果子，離開的時候我們每個人都摘了一堆，身上的口袋都塞滿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後來就再沒碰見過了，沒想到這裡居然長了這麼多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們可以多摘一些帶回去，讓大家都嚐嚐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我今天帶你出來可不是為了摘果子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我、我不知道這個......夜半小姐，你還有其他什麼事嗎？我以為我們就是來外面走走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你緊張什麼？跟我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你、你別拉我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_caveentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓，小聲點，洞穴裡藏著一隻大傢伙，別嚇到它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（你為什麼要帶我來這裡？太危險了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（危險？有我在，你很安全好嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（專業老師曾經講過，野外工作需要我們盡可能避開野生動物的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（停，誰管你的老師怎麼說，注意看，它要出來了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "細微的響動從洞穴中傳來，桑葚瞇起眼睛，想要看個仔細。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但過了半天，聲音沉寂下去，只有洞穴前方的灌木在被風吹過後，發出沙沙的響動。\n就在她快要失去耐性，想要叫旁邊那個人一起回營地時，一隻野獸從洞穴中探出頭來。\n它肌肉結實，皮毛光滑，張著嘴，粗壯的獠牙清晰可見，可以輕鬆咬斷獵物的喉管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（好、好大一隻......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我、我有點害怕，夜半，我們，那個......回去吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（放心，這個距離它發現不了我們。你這麼著急地爬起來，反而會讓它注意到這裡。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（可、可是我......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（別著急離開，再等一下。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "野獸兇猛的樣子讓桑葚不由得把半張臉埋進雙臂間，只露出一雙眼睛，偷偷打量著它在洞穴口抽動鼻子的樣子。\n似乎是確定周圍沒有危險，那隻野獸鬆懈下來，從咽喉裡滾出幾聲嚎叫，像是在呼喚著什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "很快，一隻小獸步履蹣跚，慢慢地從洞穴中走出。\n或許是因為泥土濕滑，它還沒走幾步就狠狠跌了一跤，腦袋撞上了野獸的後腿。\n野獸絲毫不惱，只是回過頭輕輕舔舐它的腦袋，鼓勵它再次站起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（加油，你一定可以的，小寶寶。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哇哇哇，它做到了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（好、好可愛啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我之前來這裡尋找食物的時候發現了懷孕的它，算算日子，我估計它的孩子應該誕生了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（真好，和媽媽在一起，它什麼都不用怕。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（看，它們要離開了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（它們要去哪裡？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（它們得趁秋天的時候吃得飽飽的，這樣才好度過漫長寒冷的冬天。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，別看了，它們都跑得不見影了，我們也該回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒見過這樣的場景，從來沒有。啊不，其實在紀錄片裡面看到過，但是那樣不算數的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有親眼見到的這麼震撼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "震撼？很稀鬆平常的事情啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夜半小姐以前生活的地方一定常常能看到這樣美好的場景，所以才會說出這樣的話來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你說的對，總能看見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要記得寫下來呀，夜半小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？記得什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記得寫進發往本艦的報告裡，這可是很特殊的見聞呢，很值得一提。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......知道了，會寫的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不許拖到最後一天才寫哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了好了，快走吧，我帶你去摘那些果子，營地裡的大家應該都想嚐嚐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應該是那句話觸怒了夜半小姐吧，怪我不會看氣氛，講出那麼掃興的話。按她的個性，一定對那些條條框框很抵觸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，博士，怎麼辦？現在夜半小姐已經離開，我才後知後覺地反應過來，想道歉也沒有機會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這不是你的錯，不必介懷。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我想，你其實遺憾的不是沒有道歉，而是沒有道別吧。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是或者不是，現在談什麼都晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你倆在這裡嘀嘀咕咕什麼呢？哎，博士，我的申請書批下來了沒有？遞上去好多天了，怎麼一點動靜都沒有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們正在討論。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你應該先敲門。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，婆婆媽媽的，麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夜半小姐，嗚......我以為你已經離開了，我還想，都沒和你告別......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不是你們規定了離開前必須提交報告，然後等待批准嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......主要是，你不是很厭惡這些規定嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "待了這麼久，我清楚，你們的規定自有你們的道理，雖然不喜歡，但也不是不能適應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再者......這裡有朋友，不能不告而別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你必須離開的理由是什麼呢，夜半小姐。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你為什麼不願意留在這裡呢？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對啊，夜半小姐，如果你有哪裡不適應，盡可以提出來，我們都會幫助你解決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是這裡的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是因為這裡，難道是因為這裡的人嗎？你、你是不是因為討厭我，才、才不願意留下的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從來沒有這麼想過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不討厭我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你人很好，工作負責，業務能力也強。我直到現在才離開，就是因為你需要我幫忙，不然我早就走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要你幫忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對啊，你還記不記得那天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，夜半小姐，你怎麼來了，是身體不舒服嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，勞煩問下，桑葚在裡面嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，你......是在等她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說她的任務結束了，昨天就回艦了，但是直到現在我都沒有看到她，怎麼，她受傷了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那她在幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次救援任務帶回來的患者數目遠超估計，醫療部的人手緊缺，所以暫時借調桑葚小姐來這裡為一些輕症病人做應急治療。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不太好吧？她可是剛剛出完外勤任務回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她執意留下，本來她應該第二天再來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你似乎很擔心她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你為什麼一臉不可思議的表情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒，只是桑葚小姐提起你的時候總是唉聲嘆氣，她好像覺得你並不喜歡和她相處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，我從來沒這麼說過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好，大家都希望你能多幫幫她呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫她，為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桑葚小姐的專業能力值得信賴，但是年紀還小，在荒地上的生存經驗尚且不足，有你在，正好帶她學些東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那現在她的工作結束了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應該早就結束了啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......呼......大叔、你受傷......別亂動......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，桑葚小姐居然就這麼靠著衣櫃門睡著了，一定是累壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她唸些什麼呢？睡都睡不踏實......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小帽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小帽",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓那傢伙睡得更深些吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小帽",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咻——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，幫個忙可以嗎？讓這傢伙趴到我背上，睡在這裡可不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，哦哦，好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是的，光會給我找麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來那天把我送回宿舍的人是夜半小姐你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然呢？那天你能睡得那麼香，可是多虧了小帽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我誤會了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "r"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就是愛多想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我想，或許誤會產生的原因不僅僅是多想。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "可夜半小姐你的講話方式也很容易讓人誤會啊。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起，我之前相處的人裡，沒有你這樣的女孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是故意想讓你難過的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，既然、既然誤會澄清了，夜半小姐，請你留下吧！我在這裡學到了很多，一定可以幫助你穩定病情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我......還是想回到荒地上，那裡的生活對我來說，更加愜意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這不是問題，有很多外勤任務都需要幹員外出。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你可以專門負責荒地上的外勤任務。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不一樣，還是不一樣。我知道，在這裡我能衣食無憂，還有藥物可以控制我的病情。我認識了新的同伴，學會了新的技能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人應該知足的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可有些時候，晚上醒來，盯著白花花的天花板，沒有月亮，沒有星星，沒有蟲鳴，心裡還是空落落的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的直覺告訴我，我的內心呼喚我，我的念頭折磨我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那只不過是很簡單的一句話——\n我要活在一抬頭就能看到天空的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道......你身體的狀況有多糟糕嗎，夜半小姐？那片天空它要如何保護你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不同意！你的申請我不批准！博士，請您也不要批准夜半小姐的申請書！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桑葚，聽我說，我知道我的選擇不多，所以我才要認認真真，選出自己最想要的那個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還記得我帶你去看的那隻野獸嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......一直記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "荒地上，那樣的野獸有很多，很多很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾年前，我還遇到過一隻眠獸。那是個強壯的孩子，看到它第一眼，我就下定決心要將它馴服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我幾次嘗試靠近與交流，都被它拒絕。它一旦見到我，立刻就逃得無影無蹤。好吃的食物，綿軟的暖窩，它都無動於衷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一次意外，它被自己的獵物傷害，我將它救下，帶回營地治療。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隨著它的傷勢逐漸好轉，它對我從一開始的警惕滿滿，變為後來的親暱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為自己已將它馴服，不再時時刻刻都盯著它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在一次簡短的狩獵過後，我回到營地，它已經不在了，只留下我給它織的一頂小帽子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很生氣，荒地上毛線並不好搞到手......我以為它很喜歡這頂帽子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "於是順著它的足跡，我跟了上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等我找到它時，看見它在一片沙地中打滾，滾得髒兮兮的。但它非常快樂，是我見過的最快樂的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後我便轉身離開了，那一刻我深知，它不屬於我，它屬於那片沙地，屬於那片廣闊的沙漠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......好了",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我明白了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "夜半小姐，你的辭行申請我批准了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "從此以後你的身份恢復為羅德島的合作幹員，不必再駐艦了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果非要離開......至少、至少你離開前，記得帶足藥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快點啊，快點接通啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂？有人在聽嗎？我是幹員桑葚，在前往龍門的任務途中遭遇特大沙暴，請求緊急支援！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人嗎？有人在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的沒辦法了嗎？怎麼辦，難道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我會死在這裡吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好餓，好睏，好難受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒人會來吧......根本沒人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......爸爸......媽媽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起......我真的......堅持不住了......"
    },
    {
